<main class="write-main"><h1>Footer visitor statistics</h1><?php foreach(flashes()as$f):?><p class="notice" role="status"><?=e($f['message'])?></p><?php endforeach;?><?php if($error):?><p class="notice error" role="alert"><?=e($error)?></p><?php endif;?>
<section class="settings-card"><h2>Monthly website activity</h2><p>Status: <?=e($statistics['status']??'Not refreshed')?>. <a href="<?=url('/write/google#diagnostics')?>">Google diagnostics</a></p><p>The public footer shows visitors (GA4 active users) and visits (sessions) for the current calendar month in the Analytics property’s time zone. Counts refresh hourly and reset automatically at the start of each month. Only the stream matching this website’s deployed tag is included.</p><p>Missing, thresholded or stale readings stay hidden publicly. No prior-month or lifetime total is relabelled as this month. Consent choices, blockers and processing can affect counts. Public pages never call Google directly.</p><form method="post"><?=csrf_field()?><button class="wbtn primary">Refresh verified statistics</button></form><p>Month: <?=e($statistics['month']??'Not refreshed')?> · Visitors: <?=isset($statistics['monthly_visitors'])?number_format($statistics['monthly_visitors']):'Unavailable'?> · Visits: <?=isset($statistics['monthly_visits'])?number_format($statistics['monthly_visits']):'Unavailable'?></p></section></main>